{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Children have disappeared in a once-beloved daycare, now abandoned and rotting with secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toony\u2019s Daycare</i> is a first-person 3D platformer with puzzle-solving, exploration, and light horror elements. You play as a determined detective searching for missing children, all of whom were last seen at a seemingly innocent daycare run by the mysterious and eccentric \u201cDr. Toony.\u201d But beneath the cheerful paint and colorful playgrounds lies something far more sinister \u2014 twisted creations, mad scientists, and mind-bending puzzles that challenge your mind and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate this mysterious location, you\u2019ll uncover hidden truths, face monstrous horrors, and push deeper into Toony\u2019s delusions. Platform your way through surreal environments, solve intricate puzzles, and survive encounters with creatures made from corrupted imagination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Solve mind-bending puzzles embedded into the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Exploration:</strong> Discover clues, notes, and eerie video logs to uncover what happened to the missing children \u2014 and why Toony wants to keep them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Nightmarish Creations:</strong> Battle or evade bizarre monsters brought to life by Toony\u2019s warped imagination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Twisted Playground:</strong> Bright and colorful visuals clash with eerie atmosphere to create a uniquely unsettling world where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you bring the children home\u2026 or become another lost soul in Toony\u2019s machinations?</strong></p>",